[I] NetSurf JavaScript binding generator

[T] nsgenbind is a tool from the NetSurf project that generates JavaScript
[T] to DOM bindings from W3C WebIDL files and a binding configuration file.
[T] It is used to build NetSurf's JavaScript support.

[U] https://download.netsurf-browser.org

[A] Netsurf
